# maximum attainable -- tau250 reached 80% of its cap -- not a null. Reading them as
# "the formant does not follow the alternation" would have been flatly wrong, and it
# is the reading I would have taken. The pole that attenuates the signal also rotates
# it, and the statistic has to undo the phase before judging transmission.
#
